    Bug 2037417 - Remove defunct override for getScreenshotUrlForAddon. r=aleca


    Method broke after Bug 2032014. Our preview does not differ from the Mozilla theme preview, so we could drop the override.

    Light:
    - https://searchfox.org/comm-central/source/mail/themes/addons/light/preview.svg
    - https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/source/browser/themes/addons/light/preview.svg

    Dark:
    - https://searchfox.org/comm-central/source/mail/themes/addons/dark/preview.svg
    - https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/source/browser/themes/addons/dark/preview.svg

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298810

